<script>
let basic_code = #"<settings id="prefs" on-change="handle_setting_changed" default-page="Editor">
  <settings-page title="General" icon="settings">
    <settings-group title="Account">
      <settings-item title="Display name" description="Shown on share cards.">
        <settings-field kind="input" property="display_name" value="Ada" />
      </settings-item>
      <settings-item title="Accent theme">
        <settings-field kind="dropdown" property="accent" value="twilight" default="twilight">
          <settings-option value="twilight" label="Twilight" />
          <settings-option value="noon" label="Noon" />
          <settings-option value="midnight" label="Midnight" />
        </settings-field>
      </settings-item>
    </settings-group>
    <settings-group title="Preferences">
      <settings-item title="Autosave" description="Persist drafts as you type." keywords="save,drafts">
        <settings-field kind="switch" property="autosave" value="true" default="false" />
      </settings-item>
      <settings-item title="Spell check" description="Underline unknown words.">
        <settings-field kind="checkbox" property="spellcheck" value="true" default="true" />
      </settings-item>
    </settings-group>
  </settings-page>
  <settings-page title="Editor" icon="code">
    <settings-group title="Editing">
      <settings-item title="Font size">
        <settings-field kind="number" property="font_size" value="14" default="14" min="10" max="24" step="1" />
      </settings-item>
      <settings-item title="Tab width">
        <settings-field kind="number" property="tab_width" value="4" min="2" max="8" step="2" />
      </settings-item>
    </settings-group>
  </settings-page>
</settings>"#;

let layout_code = #"<settings id="accessibility" group-variant="outline" size="small">
  <settings-page title="Accessibility" icon="person">
    <settings-group title="Reading">
      <settings-item title="Larger text" description="Scale text up one step across the app."
        layout="vertical" keywords="big,font,readability">
        <settings-field kind="switch" property="larger_text" value="false" default="false" />
      </settings-item>
      <settings-item title="High contrast" description="Stronger borders and focus rings."
        layout="vertical">
        <settings-field kind="switch" property="contrast" value="true" default="false" />
      </settings-item>
      <settings-item title="Screen reader hints" disabled="true" layout="vertical"
        description="Managed by the system accessibility service.">
        <settings-field kind="switch" property="hints" value="true" default="true" />
      </settings-item>
    </settings-group>
  </settings-page>
</settings>"#;
</script>

<template name="component-page-settings">
  <component-page name="Settings" description="An application preferences surface: a resizable, searchable sidebar of pages, each page holding titled group cards of labelled setting controls (switch, checkbox, text input, number input, or dropdown). The hierarchy is declared with settings-page children; field edits mirror into the component's property map and fire change handlers.">
    <component-example label="Pages, groups, and reset" id="settings_ex_basic">
      <settings
        id="settings_basic"
        on-change="handle_setting_changed"
        default-page="Editor"
        height="560"
        sidebar-width="220"
      >
        <settings-page id="settings_pg_general" title="General" icon="settings">
          <settings-group id="settings_g_account" title="Account">
            <settings-item
              id="settings_i_name"
              title="Display name"
              description="Shown on share cards."
            >
              <settings-field
                id="settings_f_name"
                kind="input"
                property="display_name"
                value="Ada"
              />
            </settings-item>
            <settings-item id="settings_i_accent" title="Accent theme">
              <settings-field
                id="settings_f_accent"
                kind="dropdown"
                property="accent"
                value="twilight"
                default="twilight"
                on-change="handle_accent_changed"
              >
                <settings-option id="settings_o_twilight" value="twilight" label="Twilight" />
                <settings-option id="settings_o_noon" value="noon" label="Noon" />
                <settings-option id="settings_o_midnight" value="midnight" label="Midnight" />
              </settings-field>
            </settings-item>
          </settings-group>
          <settings-group id="settings_g_prefs" title="Preferences">
            <settings-item
              id="settings_i_autosave"
              title="Autosave"
              description="Persist drafts as you type."
              keywords="save,drafts"
            >
              <settings-field
                id="settings_f_autosave"
                kind="switch"
                property="autosave"
                value="true"
                default="false"
              />
            </settings-item>
            <settings-item
              id="settings_i_spell"
              title="Spell check"
              description="Underline unknown words."
            >
              <settings-field
                id="settings_f_spell"
                kind="checkbox"
                property="spellcheck"
                value="true"
                default="true"
              />
            </settings-item>
          </settings-group>
        </settings-page>
        <settings-page id="settings_pg_editor" title="Editor" icon="code">
          <settings-group id="settings_g_editing" title="Editing">
            <settings-item id="settings_i_font" title="Font size">
              <settings-field
                id="settings_f_font"
                kind="number"
                property="font_size"
                value="14"
                default="14"
                min="10"
                max="24"
                step="1"
              />
            </settings-item>
            <settings-item id="settings_i_tab" title="Tab width">
              <settings-field
                id="settings_f_tab"
                kind="number"
                property="tab_width"
                value="4"
                min="2"
                max="8"
                step="2"
              />
            </settings-item>
          </settings-group>
        </settings-page>
      </settings>
      <label
        id="settings_basic_note"
        text="Defaults differ from values on autosave and accent — the page header shows a reset dial; the sidebar lists searchable pages and groups."
        size="sm"
      />
      <code-editor
        id="settings_code_basic"
        slot="code"
        language="html"
        line-number="true"
        searchable="false"
        default-value="{{ basic_code }}"
      />
    </component-example>

    <component-example label="Vertical rows, keywords, disabled" id="settings_ex_layout">
      <settings id="settings_layout" group-variant="outline" size="small" height="420">
        <settings-page id="settings_pg_access" title="Accessibility" icon="person">
          <settings-group id="settings_g_reading" title="Reading">
            <settings-item
              id="settings_i_text"
              title="Larger text"
              description="Scale text up one step across the app."
              layout="vertical"
              keywords="big,font,readability"
            >
              <settings-field
                id="settings_f_text"
                kind="switch"
                property="larger_text"
                value="false"
                default="false"
              />
            </settings-item>
            <settings-item
              id="settings_i_contrast"
              title="High contrast"
              description="Stronger borders and focus rings."
              layout="vertical"
            >
              <settings-field
                id="settings_f_contrast"
                kind="switch"
                property="contrast"
                value="true"
                default="false"
              />
            </settings-item>
            <settings-item
              id="settings_i_hints"
              title="Screen reader hints"
              description="Managed by the system accessibility service."
              layout="vertical"
              disabled="true"
            >
              <settings-field
                id="settings_f_hints"
                kind="switch"
                property="hints"
                value="true"
                default="true"
              />
            </settings-item>
          </settings-group>
        </settings-page>
      </settings>
      <label
        id="settings_layout_note"
        text="Vertical rows stack the label above the control; the disabled row trucks in at half opacity and ignores input."
        size="sm"
      />
      <code-editor
        id="settings_code_layout"
        slot="code"
        language="html"
        line-number="true"
        searchable="false"
        default-value="{{ layout_code }}"
      />
    </component-example>

    <table slot="properties" stripe="true" id="settings_props_table">
      <table-header>
        <table-column field="property" width="150">Property</table-column>
        <table-column field="type" width="90">Type</table-column>
        <table-column field="default" width="110">Default</table-column>
        <table-column field="description" width="520">Description</table-column>
      </table-header>
      <table-row>
        <table-cell><label id="settings_p_height" text="height" size="sm" /></table-cell>
        <table-cell>integer</table-cell>
        <table-cell>400</table-cell>
        <table-cell>Surface height in px; the page lists need a definite height to render.</table-cell>
      </table-row>
      <table-row>
        <table-cell><label id="settings_p_size" text="size" size="sm" /></table-cell>
        <table-cell>string</table-cell>
        <table-cell>medium</table-cell>
        <table-cell>Scales the composition: xsmall, small, medium, or large.</table-cell>
      </table-row>
      <table-row>
        <table-cell><label id="settings_p_sidebar_width" text="sidebar-width" size="sm" /></table-cell>
        <table-cell>integer</table-cell>
        <table-cell>250</table-cell>
        <table-cell>Initial sidebar width in px; the divider is draggable between 160 and 360.</table-cell>
      </table-row>
      <table-row>
        <table-cell><label id="settings_p_group_variant" text="group-variant" size="sm" /></table-cell>
        <table-cell>string</table-cell>
        <table-cell>normal</table-cell>
        <table-cell>Default group surface: normal (flat), fill, or outline; per-group variant overrides it.</table-cell>
      </table-row>
      <table-row>
        <table-cell><label id="settings_p_default_page" text="default-page" size="sm" /></table-cell>
        <table-cell>string</table-cell>
        <table-cell>none</table-cell>
        <table-cell>Title of the page selected initially; unknown titles fall back to the first page.</table-cell>
      </table-row>
      <table-row>
        <table-cell><label id="settings_p_on_change" text="on-change" size="sm" /></table-cell>
        <table-cell>handler</table-cell>
        <table-cell>none</table-cell>
        <table-cell>Any field changed; receives property=value (for example autosave=true).</table-cell>
      </table-row>
      <table-row>
        <table-cell><label id="settings_c_page" text="settings-page" size="sm" /></table-cell>
        <table-cell>child</table-cell>
        <table-cell>—</table-cell>
        <table-cell>One sidebar entry: title, description, icon, and default-open; children are settings-group cards.</table-cell>
      </table-row>
      <table-row>
        <table-cell><label id="settings_c_group" text="settings-group" size="sm" /></table-cell>
        <table-cell>child</table-cell>
        <table-cell>—</table-cell>
        <table-cell>A titled card of items: title, description, and variant (normal, fill, or outline).</table-cell>
      </table-row>
      <table-row>
        <table-cell><label id="settings_c_item" text="settings-item" size="sm" /></table-cell>
        <table-cell>child</table-cell>
        <table-cell>—</table-cell>
        <table-cell>A labelled row: title, description, keywords (search-only, comma-separated), disabled, and layout (horizontal or vertical).</table-cell>
      </table-row>
      <table-row>
        <table-cell><label id="settings_c_field" text="settings-field" size="sm" /></table-cell>
        <table-cell>child</table-cell>
        <table-cell>—</table-cell>
        <table-cell>The control: kind (switch, checkbox, input, number, or dropdown — `kind` rather than `type`, which is reserved for the component's own type), property (key for the value store and read-back), value (seed), default (reset), min/max/step (number), and on-change (receives the new value).</table-cell>
      </table-row>
      <table-row>
        <table-cell><label id="settings_c_option" text="settings-option" size="sm" /></table-cell>
        <table-cell>child</table-cell>
        <table-cell>—</table-cell>
        <table-cell>One dropdown choice: value (stored and reported) and label (displayed).</table-cell>
      </table-row>
    </table>
  </component-page>
</template>
